TurboKod VGA 16x32 by Anders Hovmöller is a derivative of Px437 IBM VGA 8x16
from the Oldschool PC Font Resource by VileR:

    https://int10h.org/oldschool-pc-fonts/

Changes: the glyphs are redrawn on a 16x32 pixel grid; the original 8x16
bitmaps are embedded unchanged as a 16px bitmap strike.

